BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OnDemand Andragogy - Kyriakos Tsoukalas [Colgate University]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T110000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T112500
DTSTAMP:20261020T211453Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-CFFQDM@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:Open OnDemand enables the execution of passenger applications
 \, which can be utilized for self-paced learning and andragogy through Gen
 AI-powered tools. The GenAI tutor paradigm can now be accessible on demand
 \, within the same platform\, to support a variety of user needs as soon a
 s they arise. Open OnDemand passenger applications could enable guidance o
 n basic coding\, instructions for submitting jobs with different scheduler
 s\, "chatting" with available documentation\, and accessing vital informat
 ion via microservices such as resource availability\, job-specific informa
 tion\, and efficiency reports.
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/CFFQDM/
END:VEVENT
